* Toppar stream file generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

ioformat extended

read rtf card append
* Topologies generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*
44

AUTO ANGL DIHE DRUD

! Converts cgenff atomtype to drude atom types.
! Charges are picked from cgenff stream file
! Alpha and Thole values are picked from first match of atom type in a text file containing all currently available residues.
! If it cannot find the values -1.0 and -1.3 values are assigned to the atom type.

RESI  PROH      0.0000
GROUP
ATOM C1     CD33A         -0.273  ALPHA   -1.8119  THOLE   1.1867
ATOM C2     CD32A         -0.219  ALPHA   -1.5966  THOLE   1.1693
ATOM C3     CD2O3A         0.769  ALPHA   -1.2613  THOLE   1.0543
ATOM O1     OD2C1A         0.000  ALPHA   -0.7131  THOLE   0.5698 ! You may also consider OD2C1C  OD2C3A Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM O2     OD31A          0.000  ALPHA   -0.8315  THOLE   0.7494 ! You may also consider OD31C  OD31E  OD31F Equivalent Atomtypes
ATOM H1     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H2     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H3     HDA3A          0.090 
ATOM H4     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H5     HDA2A          0.090 
ATOM H6     HDP1A          0.430 
ATOM LPO11  LPDO1         -0.271
ATOM LPO12  LPDO1         -0.271
ATOM LPO21  LPD           -0.307
ATOM LPO22  LPD           -0.308

BOND C1  C2 
BOND C1  H1 
BOND C1  H2 
BOND C1  H3 
BOND C2  C3 
BOND C2  H4 
BOND C2  H5 
BOND C3  O1 
BOND C3  O2 
BOND O2  H6 
BOND  LPO11  O1 
BOND  LPO12  O1 
BOND  LPO21  O2 
BOND  LPO22  O2 

LONE RELATIVE LPO11  O1  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE    0.00
LONE RELATIVE LPO12  O1  C3  C2 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  180.00
LONE BISECTOR LPO21  O2  C3  H6 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE   90.00
LONE BISECTOR LPO22  O2  C3  H6 DIST 0.3500 ANGLE  110.00 DIHE  270.00
END


read param card append
* Parameters generated by FFParam cgenfftoconverter
* For use with Drude force field
*

! Parameters are picked from same text file containing all currently available parameters.
! Similar approach like cgenff is applied, but it is not checked for its robustness.

BONDS
