CD2O3A   OD2C1A   623.000  1.239   ! from CD2O4A OD2C1B  PENALTY  2.000
CD2O3A   OD31A   150.000  1.330   ! from CD2O3A OD30C  PENALTY  5.000

ANGLES
CD33A   CD32A   CD2O3A   25.500  108.200   ! from CD2O3A CD31A CD33A  PENALTY 47.000
CD2O3A   CD32A   HDA2A   29.700  118.900   ! from CD2O2A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY  1.000
CD32A   CD2O3A   OD2C1A   69.300  111.800   ! from CD32A CD2O1A OD2C1A  PENALTY  4.000
CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   80.000  121.000   ! from CD31A CD2O3A OD2C3A  PENALTY 11.000
OD2C1A   CD2O3A   OD31A   90.000  123.000   ! from OD2C3A CD2O3A OD30C  PENALTY 11.000
CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   65.000  108.000   ! from CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY  7.000

DIHEDRALS
