CD33A   CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   0.200  3  0.000   ! marta from previous line, to keep the same number of parameters as proa
!CD33A   CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   0.400  1  0.000   ! from CD33A CD31A CD2O3A OD2C3A  PENALTY 14.000
!CD33A   CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   1.400  2  180.000   ! from CD33A CD31A CD2O3A OD2C3A  PENALTY 14.000
CD32A   CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   0.990  2  180.000   ! from CD2R6A CD2R6A OD31A HDP1A  PENALTY 25.000
CD2O3A   CD32A   CD33A   HDA3A   0.156  3  0.000   ! from CD2C1A CD32A CD33A HDA3A  PENALTY  5.000
OD2C1A   CD2O3A   CD32A   HDA2A   0.420  3  180.000   ! from OD2C2A CD2O2A CD32A HDA2A  PENALTY  6.000
OD2C1A   CD2O3A   OD31A   HDP1A   1.110  2  180.000   ! from OD2C3A CD2O3A OD30D HDP1A  PENALTY 30.000
